---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact WasmStore" description="Contact the WasmStore team about broken game links, new browser-game suggestions, corrections, accessibility feedback, privacy questions, or copyright takedown requests." path="/contact">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">PIXEL ARCADE · SAY HELLO</div><h1>CONTACT <span class="gradient-text">WASMSTORE</span></h1><p>Found a broken link or have an idea that could make the directory better? Send the details and help us improve the experience.</p></div></section>
  <section class="wrap contact-layout legal-contact">
    <div class="contact-copy prose">
      <p class="legal-kicker">PLAYER SUPPORT / FEEDBACK DESK</p>
      <h2>What can we help with?</h2>
      <p>Useful reports include the exact page URL, the game or project name, what you expected to happen, and what happened instead. Please avoid sending passwords, payment details, government identifiers, or other sensitive personal information.</p>
      <ul class="check-list"><li><strong>Broken or outdated link:</strong> tell us which WasmStore page and destination no longer work.</li><li><strong>Game suggestion:</strong> share the project's official page or source repository and, if available, its license information.</li><li><strong>Catalog correction:</strong> point out inaccurate controls, platform details, credits, categories, or descriptions.</li><li><strong>Accessibility feedback:</strong> include the device, browser, and steps needed to reproduce the issue.</li><li><strong>Copyright or takedown request:</strong> identify the material and your relationship to the rights involved. See the <a href="/copyright">Copyright and Takedown Policy</a>.</li><li><strong>Privacy or general question:</strong> describe the page or feature you are asking about.</li></ul>
      <div class="contact-email-card"><span class="contact-email-label">EMAIL THE PROJECT</span><a href={'mailto:'+site.contactEmail}>{site.contactEmail}</a><p>For a faster review, use a clear subject line and include relevant URLs. Please allow reasonable time for a response; we cannot promise a specific response time.</p></div>
      <h2>What happens after you write?</h2>
      <p>Your message opens in your own email application when you submit the form. The website does not send the form directly to a WasmStore server. You can review and edit the email before choosing to send it. A message is not delivered until you send it from your email application.</p>
      <p>We review reports as time and available information allow. We may ask for clarification, correct a listing, update a link, or refer you to the third-party host or rights holder where appropriate. Not every suggestion can be added, and a contact message is not a guarantee of removal or a particular decision.</p>
    </div>
    <form class="contact-form" id="contact-form" data-email={site.contactEmail}>
      <h2>Send a message</h2>
      <label for="contact-name">Your name</label><input id="contact-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120" />
      <label for="contact-email">Your email address</label><input id="contact-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="254" />
      <label for="contact-topic">What is this about?</label><select id="contact-topic" name="topic"><option>Broken game link</option><option>Game suggestion</option><option>Correction or accessibility feedback</option><option>Copyright / takedown request</option><option>Privacy question</option><option>Other enquiry</option></select>
      <label for="contact-message">Your message</label><textarea id="contact-message" name="message" rows="7" required maxlength="10000" placeholder="Include the game title, relevant page URL, and enough detail for us to understand your request."></textarea>
      <button class="button button-primary" type="submit">PREPARE EMAIL ↗</button>
      <p class="form-note" id="contact-status" aria-live="polite">Submitting opens a draft in your email app; it does not send automatically.</p>
    </form>
  </section>
  <style>
    .legal-contact{align-items:start;gap:36px;padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:64px}.legal-contact .contact-copy{max-width:760px}.legal-kicker{font:700 11px/1.5 var(--font-pixel);letter-spacing:.08em;color:#6b55d8}.legal-contact h2{font-family:var(--font-pixel);font-size:clamp(18px,2vw,24px);line-height:1.4;text-transform:uppercase}.legal-contact .contact-copy p,.legal-contact li{line-height:1.8}.legal-contact a{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.contact-email-card{margin-top:26px;padding:20px;background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--ink);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--ink)}.contact-email-label{display:block;font:700 11px var(--font-pixel);margin-bottom:12px}.contact-email-card>a{font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(16px,2vw,22px);color:#5b43c6}.contact-email-card p{margin-bottom:0}.contact-form{min-width:0}.contact-form h2{margin-top:0}.contact-form input,.contact-form select,.contact-form textarea{width:100%;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}.contact-form label{display:block;margin:16px 0 7px;font-weight:700}.contact-form button{margin-top:18px;max-width:100%;white-space:normal}.form-note{line-height:1.6}@media(max-width:760px){.legal-contact{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:24px;padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px}.contact-form{width:100%}}
  </style>
</BaseLayout>